 a seasoned stuntman would think twice before using that staircase."]}, {"id": "w048", "head": "think twice (before doing sth)", "pos": "phrase", "meaning": "consider something carefully before doing it", "examples": ["Even a seasoned stuntman would think twice."]}, {"id": "w049", "head": "time flew by", "pos": "phrase", "meaning": "time passed very quickly", "examples": ["It flew by so fast!"]}, {"id": "w051", "head": "upbeat", "pos": "", "meaning": "cheerful and positive", "examples": ["It''s upbeat, tasteful, and appropriate!"]}, {"id": "w052", "head": "reinforce the banks", "pos": "phrase", "meaning": "make the sides of a river or pond stronger", "examples": ["I suggest reinforcing the banks with stones so the soil doesn''t get washed away."]}]}, {"id": "rt2", "title": "Neutral · everyday 2", "words": [{"id": "w053", "head": "get washed away", "pos": "phrase", "meaning": "be carried away by water", "examples": ["...so the soil doesn''t get washed away."]}, {"id": "w059", "head": "put sb in their place", "pos": "phrase", "meaning": "show someone that they are less important than they think", "examples": ["She put him in his place."]}, {"id": "w060", "head": "moodiness", "pos": "", "meaning": "the tendency to change moods suddenly; a mysterious, sad atmosphere", "examples": ["His photography captures the moodiness of the landscape."]}, {"id": "w068", "head": "a mood booster", "pos": "phrase", "meaning": "something that makes you feel happier", "examples": ["This coffee is a real mood booster!"]}, {"id": "w069", "head": "keep an eye on sb/sth", "pos": "phrase", "meaning": "watch someone or something carefully", "examples": ["It''s easier than keeping an eye on a pot on the stove."]}, {"id": "w074", "head": "cross sth out", "pos": "phrase", "meaning": "draw a line through something written", "examples": ["If you make a mistake, just cross it out."]}, {"id": "w075", "head": "air out sth", "pos": "phrase", "meaning": "let fresh air into a room", "examples": ["We would